								span.icon.mdi.mdi-star
								span.icon.mdi.mdi-star
								span.icon.mdi.mdi-star
								span.icon.mdi.mdi-star-half
						p Candidatus de superbus usus, quaestio repressor! Camerarius, raptus capios virtualiter contactus de lotus, dexter ionicis tormento. Dexter clinias virtualiter anhelares coordinatae est. Ubi est clemens vigil? Cum apolloniates favere, omnes monses amor alter, flavum gloses.
						hr.hr-24.hr-gray-100
						ul.list-description
							li
								span Categories:
								span Helmets
							li
								span Weight:
								span 57.32 oz
							li
								span Dimensions:
								span 9.8 x 0.6 x 0.4 in
						.group-md.group-middle
							.stepper-style-1: input( type='number', data-zeros='true', value='1', min='1', max='1000')
							div: a.button.button-lg.button-gradient( href='cart-page.html' ) Add to cart
						hr.hr-30.hr-gray-100
						.group-md.group-middle
							span.list-social-title Share
							div: ul.list-social.list-inline.list-inline-md
